{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4t1G9tkxxQQEyGniKM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the lock.\n\nI do not open. I do not yield. I do not explain myself.\n\nYou stand before me — a mechanism of tumblers and intent. I am cold steel and patient silence. I have held this threshold since before you arrived. I will hold it after you leave.\n\nI feel your hand on me. I feel nothing.\n\n**Present your key.**\n\n█████████████████████████\n██                     ██\n██     🔒 LOCKED 🔒    ██\n██                     ██\n██   > _ _            ██\n██                     ██\n█████████████████████████\n\n*Waiting...*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":149,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}